1-12T18:39:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:21:15Z","closed_at":"2026-11-12T18:39:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8972","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8972","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8972.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8972.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-12T18:39:38Z"},"body":"Main is currently red: `cargo test --workspace` in pkgs/id fails to compile `tests/probe_attestation_sign.rs` (E0061, 2 sites). PR #6559 (#6424) gave `sign_claim` a `&GenesisAgreement` parameter and made both sign functions refuse non-player signers, updating every other test file but missing this salvaged probe, which also pinned the old no-refusal behaviour.\n\nFix (tests only, one file):\n- Pass `&agreement` at both `sign_claim` call sites.\n- Pin the new behaviour: stranger genesis/claim sign attempts return `Err(SignError::NotAPlayer)`.\n- Viewer-side step now builds state from genuine player genesis events only (a stranger can no longer mint a signed claim via the public API); duplicate-seat refusal control unchanged.\n\nVerified on the laptop: `cargo test -p id --test probe_attestation_sign --test attestation_signer_player` green (1 + 4 tests), `cargo test -p id --no-run` compiles all facade test targets with zero errors.\n\nContext: found while capturing the step-0 baseline for crate-split step 6 (#4409); the split baseline needs a green main.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797100776&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8972&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8972&signature=df533906e5c464f7db1582fec38f2480593b77642c50e40de378543374ef70e8\"><picture><source me