 new `tests/attestation_signer_player.rs` (4); existing attestation tests updated for the new signature. 20 attestation tests pass locally.\n- Also fixes two `str` vs `String` comparisons in `world_net.rs` (lines 658, 1621) that stopped the `id` lib compiling on main `9c06d0c8a4` (rustc 1.99.0). Unrelated to the issue; included so tests can build.\n\nQueue task 10870.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796573959&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=6559&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F6559&signature=157c843f0632aee3490fd52074d160ee9146942b130f785357c2d79adae92f1d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/6559?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6559/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6559/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/11195","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_