ull,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/11195","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/11195","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/11195.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/11195.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-17T11:04:21Z"},"body":"Refs #6487\n\nCommits the sign-time refusal contract design record that task 12944's packet identified as the one remainder of #6487: the seven signer filings (#6422, #6424, #6434, #6443, #6447, #6451, #6469) have all landed, but the contract itself was committed nowhere in the repo.\n\n`doc/2026-11-17_design_id_sign_time_refusal.md` carries, with nothing re-decided:\n\n1. The contract verbatim from #6487's body — the four contract rules.\n2. The decidability classes (a)–(d) (rule 2 of the contract).\n3. The per-signer pins for all seven filings.\n4. The receipt-only (class-(d)) inventory, each item named with its reason, plus the Phase 4 / #6488 closing-inventory dispositions.\n5. A live status table for the seven filings with closing PRs and merge SHAs, verified fresh at writing time (2026-11-17): #6422→PR #8677 `a222c693`, #6424→PR #6559 `f998d270`, #6434→PR #6497 `c0ce60b1`, #6443→PR #6539 `3bd39e6f`, #6447→PR #6544 `ef3f1c10`, #6451→PR #6500 `85c435ec`, #6469→PR #8011 `6c5af5b8`.\n6. An explicit statement that the goal-workspace design doc the issue references (`files/designs/code-id-sign-time-refusal.md`) could not be read — the path does not exist on the laptop — so the issue body is the source of record.\n\nDocs only; no signer implemented or changed. #6487 stays open as the epic tracker for its owner to close (per the packet, not auto-closed here).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797501506&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=11195&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F11195&signature=7eb0095f1f63902fe0f0675aab9d5b9eb6b42a393c0403c3611d1d46340e57d2\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/11195?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/11195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/11195/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6497","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6497/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6497/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6497/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/6497","id":6240848715,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNSDYgw","number":6497,"title":"fix(id): validate match-audit signing inputs at sign time (#6434)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":13198401620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-gVA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:completed-later","name":"audit:completed-later","color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":"Gap completed by later merged PR","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-06T10:16:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:22:08Z","closed_at":"2026-11-06T10:24:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/6497","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/6497","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/6497.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/6497.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-06T10:24:09Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #6434. `sign_header` and `sign_footer` in `pkgs/id/src/match_audit.rs` signed malformed, dead-on-arrival inputs that `verify_integrity` later rejects. The header-local and footer-local checks now run at sign time, before a signature exists:\n\n- `sign_header` refuses an unsupported format version (`AuditErrorV0::UnsupportedVersion`), an empty or duplicate-key roster (`AuditErrorV0::Roster` via the existing `validate_roster`), and a caller key absent from `header.players` (new `AuditErrorV0::SignerNotInRoster`).\n- `sign_footer` refuses a caller key absent from `header.players` (`SignerNotInRoster`) and a seed reveal whose digest differs from `header.seed_commitment` (new `AuditErrorV0::SeedCommitmentMismatch`).\n- The new variants map in `integrity_reason` to `InvalidRoster` and `SeedCommitmentMismatch` respectively.\n\n`verify_integrity`, the serialized wire format, and tick/chain-context validation are unchanged. Sibling sign-time fixes #6422 and #6424 are out of scope.\n\n## Tests\n\n`cargo test -p id match_audit` — 18 passed, 0 failed, including 7 new tests:\n\n- `sign_header_refuses_unsupported_version`\n- `sign_header_refuses_empty_roster`\n- `sign_header_refuses_duplicate_roster`\n- `sign_header_refuses_non_roster_signer`\n- `sign_footer_refuses_non_roster_signer`\n- `sign_footer_refuses_seed_commitment_mismatch`\n- `sign_header_and_footer_accept_roster_signers` (valid control)\n\n`cargo fmt --check` and `git diff --check` pass. Well-formed signing and `export_tic_tac_toe_reference` are covered by the unchanged existing tests (`signed_log_round_trips_and_verifies`, `reference_export_replays_and_keeps_actual_validity_inconclusive`).\n\nQueue: task 10975 (repo-health-code-pilot), lane code-z.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796552206&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=6497&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F6497&signature=a20d551f1d3e94c8a203473e5a8ef072efa02b040f3d172d270096042d315ce8\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/6497?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6497/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6497/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}